### Pruebas rápidas del broker (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
@base = http://localhost:8090
@rm = http://localhost:8180/cse.api.v1

### Salud
GET {{base}}/health

### Login del cliente semilla (cualquier clave en desarrollo)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/customer/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "+17875550142", "password": "1234" }

### Guarda el token
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Perfil + cartera
GET {{base}}/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Estaciones con precios vigentes
GET {{base}}/v1/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Catálogo del minimarket
GET {{base}}/v1/stations/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1 · Crear la orden (techo $30 de regular + un café)
# @name order
POST {{base}}/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "fuelCode": "r87",
  "capAmount": 30,
  "items": [{ "itemCode": "MM-CAFE-16", "qty": 1 }]
}

@orderId = {{order.response.body.id}}

### 2 · Autorizar la retención (techo + minimarket)
POST {{base}}/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/authorize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3 · «Estoy aquí» — surtidor 3 (dispara FuelPumpAuthorize en RM)
POST {{base}}/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/arrive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pumpNumber": 3 }

### Estado de la orden
GET {{base}}/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Login del empleado semilla
# @name emp
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/employee/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "badge": "EMP-0142", "pin": "1234" }

@etoken = {{emp.response.body.token}}

### Cola del handheld
GET {{base}}/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{etoken}}

### Cierre manual del surtido (respaldo cuando no llega el pulso del PTS-2)
# Reemplaza <taskId> con el id de la tarea
POST {{base}}/v1/tasks/<taskId>/close
Authorization: Bearer {{etoken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dispensedAmount": 21.40 }

### Recibo
GET {{base}}/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Operación
GET {{base}}/v1/admin/overview

###
GET {{base}}/v1/admin/rm/ping

###
GET {{base}}/v1/admin/pts/status

### Directo a Retail Manager, para comparar
GET {{rm}}/ServerTime

###
GET {{rm}}/FuelPumpStatus?Pump=1
